title Trends Discovery Flow (Deterministic in Autopilot)

actor "User / Orchestrator" as User
participant "CampaignOrchestrator" as Orch
database "BigQuery" as BQ
database "YouTube Data API v3" as YT
database "Session State" as State

User -> Orch: Start TRENDS Stage
note right of Orch
  Deterministic mode:
  No LLM in autopilot
end note

Orch -> BQ: Query Google Trends (get_daily_gtrends)
BQ --> Orch: Trending Search Terms

Orch -> YT: Fetch YouTube Trends (get_youtube_trends)
YT --> Orch: Trending Videos

Orch -> State: Save search_trends_summary
Orch -> State: Save yt_trends_summary
State -> State: Update State

Orch --> User: Trends Summary (No LLM)

@endum
